 ('admin.bundles_intro','en','A basket groups several Hornafresh products at a single price. On order, each component''s stock is decremented; displayed availability accounts for the number of baskets and the components'' stock.'),('admin.bundles_intro','zh','套装篮将多个 Hornafresh 产品以单一价格组合。下单时每个组成商品的库存都会扣减；显示的可用量考虑篮子数量和组成商品库存。'),('admin.bundles_intro','am','ቅርጫት ብዙ የ Hornafresh ምርቶችን በአንድ ዋጋ ያሰባስባል። በትዕዛዝ ጊዜ የእያንዳንዱ አካል ክምችት ይቀነሳል፤ የሚታየው ተገኝነት የቅርጫቶችን ብዛት እና የአካላትን ክምችት ያካትታል።'),('admin.bundles_intro','so','Dambiil waxay isku keentaa alaabo badan oo Hornafresh ah hal qiimo. Marka la dalbado, kaydka qayb kasta waa la dhimayaa; helitaanka la muujiyo wuxuu tixgelinayaa tirada dambiilaha iyo kaydka qaybaha.'),('admin.bundles_intro','aa','Dambiil waxay isku keentaa alaabo badan oo Hornafresh ah hal qiimo. Marka la dalbado, kaydka qayb kasta waa la dhimayaa; helitaanka la muujiyo wuxuu tixgelinayaa tirada dambiilaha iyo kaydka qaybaha.'),
